* LT3094 negative LDO: -7 V input, -5 V output
.lib LT3094.sub

VINPUT IN 0 -7

CIN IN 0 10u
RSET SET 0 49.9k
CSET SET 0 10n
RILIM ILIM 0 2.49k

RPG1 OUT PGFB 470k
RPG2 PGFB 0 30.1k
RPG PG 0 100k

COUT OUT 0 10u
RLOAD OUT 0 5k

XU1 IN OUT SET 0 ILIM IN PGFB PG OUT LT3094

.tran 0 20m 0 10u startup
.meas tran vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM=15m TO=20m

.end
